- attach_equipment: pre: (candidate_prepared ?candidate) (equipment_available ?equipment_resource) (not (candidate_equipment_linked ?candidate ?equipment_resource)). effect: (candidate_equipment_linked ?candidate ?equipment_resource) (not (equipment_available ?equipment_resource))

