- load_container_onto_leg: pre: (candidate_prepared ?candidate) (candidate_transport_leg_linked ?candidate ?transport_leg) (candidate_loading_container_linked ?candidate ?loading_container) (loading_container_available ?loading_container) (transport_leg_assembled ?transport_leg) (transport_leg_loading_authorized ?transport_leg) (not (loading_container_loaded ?loading_container)). effect: (loading_container_loaded ?loading_container) (loading_container_leg_linked ?loading_container ?transport_leg) (not (loading_container_available ?loading_container))

