- validate_route_sequence: pre: (candidate_clearance_established ?candidate) (route_sequence_context_set ?candidate) (candidate_service_window_linked ?candidate ?service_window) (candidate_origin_availability_linked ?candidate ?origin_availability) (candidate_destination_availability_linked ?candidate ?destination_availability) (origin_availability_confirmed ?origin_availability) (destination_availability_confirmed ?destination_availability) (candidate_task_profile_linked ?candidate ?route_task_profile) (not (route_sequence_validated ?candidate)). effect: (route_sequence_validated ?candidate)

