16. release_operator_resource destination_availability_alpha driver_operator_alpha

Now we have both origin and destination locked and confirmed.

Now assemble transport leg:
We need origin_availability_locked and destination_availability_locked (we have). Also origin_node_ready and destination_node_ready (we have from activate actions). Also origin_availability_confirmed and destination_availability_confirmed (we have from lock). So we can assemble.

